{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06296","headline":"辽西作 · 崔颢","name":"辽西作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕郊芳岁晚，残雪冻边城。\n四月青草合，辽阳春水生。\n胡人正牧马，汉将日徵兵。\n露重宝刀湿，沙虚金鼓鸣。\n寒衣着已尽，春服与谁成。\n寄语洛阳使，爲传边塞情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}